sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client<br/>(KServe V2 REST)
    participant Mesh as Istio Service Mesh<br/>mTLS Enforcement
    participant Proxy as rest-proxy Sidecar<br/>8008/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Marshaler as CustomJSONPb<br/>Marshaler
    participant GRPC as ModelMesh gRPC<br/>8033/TCP gRPC

    Note over Client,GRPC: Flow 1: REST Inference Request Translation

    Client->>Mesh: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer<br/>JSON body (tensor data)
    Mesh->>Proxy: Forward request<br/>(mTLS terminated or passthrough)

    activate Proxy
    Proxy->>Marshaler: Decode JSON request body
    activate Marshaler
    Note over Marshaler: Transform multi-dimensional<br/>arrays to flat tensors<br/>Handle BYTES/base64 encoding<br/>Process raw binary content
    Marshaler-->>Proxy: ModelInferRequest (protobuf)
    deactivate Marshaler

    Proxy->>GRPC: gRPC ModelInfer()<br/>8033/TCP (TLS or plaintext)
    activate GRPC
    Note over GRPC: Model inference<br/>execution
    GRPC-->>Proxy: ModelInferResponse (protobuf)
    deactivate GRPC

    Proxy->>Marshaler: Encode gRPC response
    activate Marshaler
    Note over Marshaler: Convert InferTensorContents<br/>to JSON arrays<br/>Decode RawOutputContents<br/>Map FP32/INT32/BOOL/etc types
    Marshaler-->>Proxy: JSON response body
    deactivate Marshaler
    deactivate Proxy

    Proxy-->>Mesh: HTTP 200 JSON response
    Mesh-->>Client: JSON inference result

    Note over Client,GRPC: Flow 2: Model Metadata Query

    Client->>Mesh: GET /v2/models/{name}
    Mesh->>Proxy: Forward request
    Proxy->>GRPC: gRPC ModelMetadata()
    GRPC-->>Proxy: ModelMetadataResponse
    Proxy-->>Mesh: JSON metadata
    Mesh-->>Client: Model metadata response
